+// The latch body: publish a pendingViews newer than the one last consumed. The present thread waits
+// (bounded); the left pass on the game thread passes wait=false and takes only a pair that is
+// already pending. PromotePendingViewsLocked is the poseFreeze path and bumps the promotion
